ry.py](/Assets/Python/SASBattleHistory.py), [CvEventManager.py](/Assets/Python/CvEventManager.py), [BugEventManager.py](/Assets/Python/BUG/BugEventManager.py), [CvUnit.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvUnit.cpp), [CvDllPythonEvents.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvDllPythonEvents.cpp), [CvDllPythonEvents.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvDllPythonEvents.h), [CvEventReporter.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvEventReporter.cpp), [CvEventReporter.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvEventReporter.h).
